        },
        {
          "name": "Resolution Type",
          "type": "EFieldResolutionType"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Void",
      "docs": "Generates a mapping between the Position array and the results array.\nWhen \\p ResolutionType is set to \\c Maximum the complete particle mapping\nis provided from the \\c Particles.X to \\c Particles.Attribute.\nWhen \\c Minimum is set only the ActiveIndices and the direct children of\nthe active clusters are set in the \\p IndicesArray."
